flowchart TD
    A[Users report application unavailable]
    B[Test server reachability]
    C{Server reachable?}
    D[Investigate host or network failure]
    E[Test TCP port 80]
    F{Port 80 listening?}
    G[Check Nginx service]
    H[Test backend directly on port 5050]
    I{Backend healthy?}
    J[Investigate backend failure]
    K[Review Nginx journal]
    L{Crash or orderly stop?}
    M[Investigate software or resource failure]
    N[Review SSH sudo and authentication logs]
    O[Correlate command and shutdown timestamps]
    P[Contain account and preserve evidence]
    Q[Validate configuration and restore service]
    R[Confirm HTTP external access and reboot recovery]

    A --> B --> C
    C -- No --> D
    C -- Yes --> E --> F
    F -- Yes --> J
    F -- No --> G --> H --> I
    I -- No --> J
    I -- Yes --> K --> L
    L -- Crash --> M
    L -- Orderly stop --> N --> O --> P --> Q --> R
